    "statement": "theorem actual_geometric_three_torsion_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (x y : K), W.Ψ₃.eval x = (3*x+W.a₂)*(denominator W x y)^2- W.a₁*numerator W x y*denominator W x y-(numerator W x y)^2- (12*x+W.b₂)*W.polynomial.evalEval x y) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (x y : K), ∀ hN : W.Nonsingular x y, (3 : ℕ) • WeierstrassCurve.Affine.Point.some x y hN=0 ↔ W.Ψ₃.IsRoot x) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [NeZero (3 : K)] [IsAlgClosed K], ∀ W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K, W.Δ ≠ 0 → W.Ψ₃.natDegree=4 ∧ W.Ψ₃.Separable ∧ Nat.card (Root W)=4 ∧ Nat.card (Fibers W)=8 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion W)=9 ∧ Nat.card {P : W.Point // addOrderOf P=3}=8 ∧ Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion W)=2 ∧ Nonempty (Module.Basis (Fin 2) (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion W))) ∧ (∀ (K L : Type) [Field K] [Field L] [DecidableEq L] [NeZero (3 : K)] [IsAlgClosed L], ∀ (f : K →+* L) (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K), W.Δ ≠ 0 → Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (W.map f))=9) ∧ CharP BinaryClosure 2 ∧ CharP CharThreeClosure 3 ∧ (binaryCurve.Δ ≠ 0 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion binaryCurve)=9 ∧ Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion binaryCurve)=2 ∧ Nonempty (Module.Basis (Fin 2) (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion binaryCurve))) ∧ ((short (-1 : CharThreeClosure) 0).Δ ≠ 0 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (short (-1 : CharThreeClosure) 0))=1 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (short (-1 : CharThreeClosure) 0))≠9)",
    "decl_sha256": "84ede26fa349073156b367b9891d0a825557e4d261fed598502ca55a603851db",
    "scope": "Actual geometric rank2 at prime3, no rank/basis premise. All nonsingular Weierstrass models and every algclosed fieldchar≠3, includingchar2: literal MathlibΨ3degree4/separable/root4/ordinatefibers8, actual point subgroup killed3 cardinal9, exact-order3 subtype8, induced actual ZMod3modulefinrank2 and Fin2basis. Actual all-characteristic nonsingular-point3P0iffΨ3root, universal coordinate identity before curve equation. Monic ordinate polynomial/derivative/nonzero slope denominator arguments; explicit actual subgroup/OptionFibers equivalence proves finiteness before card/rank. All algclosed scalar extensions throughactualfieldhom have9. Actual AlgebraicClosureF2/modely²+y=x³+1 nonzeroΔ/card9/rank2/basis; actual AlgebraicClosureF3/modely²=x³−x nonzeroΔ/card1/not9, bothCharP bound. Independent short proof retained. This formalizes sourceBKgeometricinput at3, not allotherprimes/Frobenius/determinant/descent/canonicalpairings/fullBK theorem/allkp500census/group-scheme étaleness. QualifiedBK and frozen corpus unchanged, nofullpaper/bookread/novelty/nativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
